    "title": "Four-star QB from Arkansas adds South Carolina offer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hale McGranahan ,\n8 hours ago Hank Hendrix is believed to be the second quarterback to land an offer from South Carolina offensive coordinator. Hendrix, who's out of Fayetteville (Ark.) High School, is the No. 9-ranked quarterback in the class of 2027, according to 247Sports. He's the No. 1 overall recruit in the state of Arkansas and is No. 117 in the country, regardless of position. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
